.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt IGT_RESUME 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm igt_resume ,
.Nm igt_results
.Nd go on with an IGT run, or write its results again
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar results
.Nm igt_results
.Ar results
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
goes on with the run of
.Xr igt_runner 1
whose directory is
.Ar results ,
with the options it was started with: it runs each subtest of the run's job list that has no result yet, as after a crash, a reboot or a run of
.Ql igt_runner -d ,
writes
.Pa results.json
again and prints
.Ql Done.
.Pp
.Nm igt_results
runs no subtest.
It writes
.Pa results.json
in
.Ar results
from what the run's subtests recorded, and prints
.Ql Results generated .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Nm
exits 0 when the run is whole, 1 when it cannot run the rest, 2 when the overall timeout stopped it, 3 when the results could not be written, and 127 when
.Ar results
cannot be read as a run.
.Nm igt_results
exits 0 when it wrote the results and 1 otherwise.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr igt_runner 1
